/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spellcasting_Implement\" title=\"Spellcasting Implement\">Spellcasting Implement +2</a>:</b> Passive: +2 <a href=\"/page/Implement_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Implement bonus\">Implement bonus</a> to Universal <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Orb Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+2 Orb Bonus</a>:</b> While this <a href=\"/page/Orb\" title=\"Orb\">orb</a> is equipped and you are actively blocking, you gain a +2 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">orb bonus</a> to all <a href=\"/page/Saving_throw\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throws</a>, as well as <a href=\"/page/Energy_Resistance\" title=\"Energy Resistance\">Acid, Cold, Fire, Electric, and Sonic resistances</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +29</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Potency\" title=\"Potency\">Potency +29</a>:</b> Passive: +29 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to each <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus_Mastery\" title=\"Spell Focus Mastery\"> Spell Focus Mastery +1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus_Mastery\" title=\"Spell Focus Mastery\"> Spell Focus Mastery +1</a>:</b> +1 Equipment bonus to the DC of all spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wizardry\" title=\"Wizardry\"> Wizardry +60</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wizardry\" title=\"Wizardry\"> Wizardry +60</a>:</b> +60 Enhancement bonus to <a href=\"/page/Spell_point\" title=\"Spell point\">spell points</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>This orb, held in the off hand, seems to radiate magical power. There is a small chip taken out of it.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817055253\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.071 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3722/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23869/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6513/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n136.45%  130.167     45 Template:IO\n100.00%   95.397      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   95.397      1 -total\n 97.18%   92.705      1 Template:Named_Shield\n 46.27%   44.144      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 45.36%   43.275      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 43.76%   41.749      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 42.72%   40.750      2 Template:InCategory\n 26.03%   24.830      7 Template:Popup\n 17.22%   16.423      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:64904-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817055253 and revision id 690664. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
